    "detailed_description": "<h1>Early Beta Access</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>FERRUM inc is a multiplayer active third-person shooter.<br><br>You will be the operator of FERRUM inc, which is engaged in producing military robots. Control your war machine, participate in 5-by-5 tactical exercises, and work as a team!<br><br>The essential mechanics of our project is the unique camera control. You can switch between first and third-person views, as well as switch to the camera-drone control mode and set it at any point on the map getting an additional point of view!<br><br>Enemies spotted by the drone will be highlighted through the obstacles and walls. You have to be careful to stay off the radar!",
    "about_the_game": "FERRUM inc is a multiplayer active third-person shooter.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou will be the operator of FERRUM inc, which is engaged in producing military robots. Control your war machine, participate in 5-by-5 tactical exercises, and work as a team!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe essential mechanics of our project is the unique camera control. You can switch between first and third-person views, as well as switch to the camera-drone control mode and set it at any point on the map getting an additional point of view!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEnemies spotted by the drone will be highlighted through the obstacles and walls. You have to be careful to stay off the radar!",
    "short_description": "Become an operator who controls a robot of FERRUM inc. Participate in 5-by-5 battles where you can choose your fighting machine and use a unique camera control system. Time to spill the oil!",
